    {
      "id": "claim_868aa169e7b14cf3996f83195f0c460d",
      "statement": "The Express middleware stack applied in order is: cors (configurable allow-list, dev defaults to http://localhost:7173) → express.json() → /uploads static → inline request logger (skips /api/health, /uploads, /favicon.ico) → auditLogMiddleware (records every mutation as a Vietnamese audit row) → router-specific authMiddleware + casbinAuthz('resource') [+ requireRoles(...)] → handler → globalErrorHandler → snake_case serializer.",
