      "id": "claim_1a9119ea03b645b894a84959a988682d",
      "statement": "Cross-cutting concerns: audit-log middleware emits one Vietnamese-language audit row per mutating API call regardless of how many tables the handler touches; the snake_case serializer rewrites response keys before they leave the API; trust-proxy is set so req.ip reflects the real client IP behind nginx; SIGTERM/SIGINT close the agent socket.io, drain HTTP, end the Postgres pool, and close Redis before exit.",
